message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  associated publication.
title: "Differential Privacy Strategies for Data Analytics in the Banking Sector"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible artifact for the paper "Differential Privacy Strategies for
  Data Analytics in the Banking Sector". The repository implements the
  private-data workflow (Local Differential Privacy via Direct Encoding)
  and the private-model workflow (Central Differential Privacy via DP-SGD)
  on two banking-related datasets: Bank Marketing (UCI) and IPBlock (Amazon
  Fraud Dataset Benchmark).
